sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Public Client
    participant F as Feed API
    participant DB as Supabase Postgres

    C->>F: GET /feed?limit=20&cursor=...
    F->>DB: active + public posts, newest first
    DB-->>F: page of posts
    F-->>C: feed + next_cursor
    C->>F: GET next cursor
    F->>DB: posts older than cursor
    DB-->>F: next page
    F-->>C: feed + next_cursor
